// Sheet describes a next-ranged-hit buff whose payload is a secondary AoE
// thorn burst on the struck target. No existing BuffKind grants an AoE
// on-hit rider (the gravesong *_smite BuffKinds each bake in one fixed
// single-target effect -- bonus damage, blind, burn, knockback, fear --
// never a burst); ships instead as gravesong/branding_smite.ron's shape
// (flat bonus damage, no secondary effect), dropping the AoE-thorn-burst
// rider. First-of-kind simplification within this batch; flag for reviewer
// attention alongside the GroundAoe pooled_debuff spells.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.1,
    cast_duration: 0.1,
    recover_duration: 0.1,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: BrandingSmite, data: BuffData(strength: 6.0, duration: None)),
    ],
    buff_cat: Some(RemoveOnAttack),
    energy_cost: 15,
    enforced_limit: true,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Primordial)),
)
